# GTK 4 and the libraries under it, each from its upstream release by its own
# build, over the libpng, FreeType, expat, libjpeg-turbo, libtiff, pixman and
# Mesa packages: Meson for FriBidi, HarfBuzz, fontconfig (whose build runs the
# gperf package), cairo, graphene, libepoxy, gdk-pixbuf, pango and GTK (its
# X11 backend alone, over x11-build's X libraries). Mesa's EGL and KHR
# headers serve libepoxy's EGL dispatch and GTK's EGL code; its libraries, a
# program that draws with OpenGL itself (Ghostty). Static libraries in
# /usr/lib, as a GTK program links them; GLib's pkg-config file has cc
# cast-emulate every GObject program, those these builds run among them.
FROM /demos/x11/Dollyfile-x11-build b8d127c6ca0d4f7e90d5c8a100cdf95d246e566efea262a129b29325eb15bdd5
